  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word which came to Jeremiah from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, and go down to the potter's house, and there I will cause thee to hear my words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I went down to the potter's house, and, behold, he wrought a work on the wheels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the vessel that he made of clay was marred in the hand of the potter: so he made it again another vessel, as seemed good to the potter to make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O house of Israel, cannot I do with you as this potter? saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Behold, as the clay",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the potter's hand, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye in mine hand, O house of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "At what",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "instant I shall speak concerning a nation, and concerning a kingdom, to pluck up, and to pull down, and to destroy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If that nation, against whom I have pronounced, turn from their evil, I will repent of the evil that I thought to do unto them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "at what",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "instant I shall speak concerning a nation, and concerning a kingdom, to build and to plant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it do evil in my sight, that it obey not my voice, then I will repent of the good, wherewith I said I would benefit them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Now therefore go to, speak to the men of Judah, and to the inhabitants of Jerusalem, saying, Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Behold, I frame evil against you, and devise a device against you: return ye now every one from his evil way, and make your ways and your doings good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they said, There is no hope: but we will walk after our own devices, and we will every one do the imagination of his evil heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Ask ye now among the heathen, who hath heard such things: the virgin of Israel hath done a very horrible thing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "a man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leave the snow of Lebanon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which cometh",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the rock of the field?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall the cold flowing waters that come from another place be forsaken?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because my people hath forgotten me, they have burned incense to vanity, and they have caused them to stumble in their ways",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the ancient paths, to walk in paths,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a way not cast up;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To make their land desolate,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a perpetual hissing; every one that passeth thereby shall be astonished, and wag his head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will scatter them as with an east wind before the enemy; I will shew them the back, and not the face, in the day of their calamity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then said they, Come, and let us devise devices against Jeremiah; for the law shall not perish from the priest, nor counsel from the wise, nor the word from the prophet. Come, and let us smite him with the tongue, and let us not give heed to any of his words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give heed to me, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and hearken to the voice of them that contend with me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall evil be recompensed for good? for they have digged a pit for my soul. Remember that I stood before thee to speak good for them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to turn away thy wrath from them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore deliver up their children to the famine, and pour out their",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "blood",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by the force of the sword; and let their wives be bereaved of their children, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "widows; and let their men be put to death;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "let",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their young men",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "slain by the sword in battle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let a cry be heard from their houses, when thou shalt bring a troop suddenly upon them: for they have digged a pit to take me, and hid snares for my feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou knowest all their counsel against me to slay",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "me:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "forgive not their iniquity, neither blot out their sin from thy sight, but let them be overthrown before thee; deal",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thus",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with them in the time of thine anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
